<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:49:46 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Philippians</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Phi-lip</para>
  <para style="toc2">Phi-lip</para>
  <para style="toc3">Php</para>
  <para style="mt">Phi-lip</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1" />Phao-lô ji Ti-mô-thê, xapok ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, atăq ka dêq hloay khơl vah đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, laa khơl manih tuôq măn aduq theng Phi-lip, kung dii khơl muk sư ji khơl châp sưq. <verse eid="PHP 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2" />Apôôy vanong plêêk ji varơuq hrok hrol xing Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq ji Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, măn tol oh ay.<verse eid="PHP 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3" />Gô kuh kway Kơy Plêêk ku gô đom tôôy varơuq văch truh oh ay, <verse eid="PHP 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4" />đom tôôy apok apôôy ku gô ka dêq hloay oh ay, hloay tơơk tưp apok apôôy dii xuum hlah hlaak <verse eid="PHP 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5" />vii kơq varơuq jưq phon ku oh ay đom Hêêl Kaxay xing hngơy kapa tep dong truh juneq; <verse eid="PHP 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6" />vii tuôq kajưk truh jơq varơuq neq, đaneq Kơy heq xarôp dơơp varơuq kaxay đom oh ay hnoq dơơp xaleep dong truh hngơy ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu; <verse eid="PHP 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7" />đôôyq dii gô, dik laa varơuq jơq dik xôq biit đanưq truh dêq hloay oh ay, vii gô jư oh ay đom xuum gô, dêq hloay oh ay raay laa khơl kung dơơp varơuq dii gô bơyh vanong plêêk, kaah đom talơy looy tooy ku gô, hloay đom varơuq đnooy tagêh ji dơơp xanưk ka Hêêl Kaxay. <verse eid="PHP 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8" />Vii Kơy Plêêk laa Kơy dơơp xanưk ku gô, đaleq gô thier trôôch dêq hloay oh ay bơơn xuum klaak xung xiaq ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="PHP 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9" />Ji varơuq gô apôôy nưq laa xuum xung xiaq ku oh ay viik galaay raah jôh, kưq athêêp atok 'ngưng iaq đom hok xet kung tôôy varơuq hlolh xet, <verse eid="PHP 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10" />xôq oh ay hnoq ik xet varơuq leq laa tolh nhưk, xôq ka oh ay jah xarêh xaraat ji leh aduq đnooy ik dong truh hngơy ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, <verse eid="PHP 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11" />jah viik galaay raak play ku varơuq hyioh jăk gamưh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, wih truh varơuq tađnah tađnaak ji varơuq ayuôôt laat Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="PHP 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12" />Wơơy oh ay, gô xung oh ay xet đaneq kaluh kajoq xalih truh dii gô dong dik heq xalih vlôh vii varơuq athêêp tok ku Hêêl Kaxay. <verse eid="PHP 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13" />Pheq đnooy, talơy looy tooy ku gô đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh heq jêêk vlôh ro raang măn đom katul dêq hloay bing kuun jư 'yo hnhư padrok kung tôôy khơl kadrơy, <verse eid="PHP 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14" />ji phon 'ngưng oh ay, gamưh talơy looy tooy ku gô, heq kajưk tuôq aduq Lôôk, kang dêq xuum xôq padoh taboon đaauq Lôôk kach leh kamo yôq. <verse eid="PHP 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15" />Long pheq đnooy muuyq sôôq adro padoh taboon Lôôk Wơơt Dêh vii 'yarơ ji tayaat, bơh kung e manih padoh taboon dii xuum kaxay, <verse eid="PHP 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16" />laa khơl adro vii xuum xung xiaq, xet đaneq gô jah đinq xôq đnooy bing Hêêl Kaxay, <verse eid="PHP 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17" />bơh khơl adro vii xuum hmưch trôôch kamuk, oot padoh taboon Lôôk Wơơt Dêh kach leh dong dik, biit athêêp tok pơơl hwơơl muut đom talơy looy tooy ku gô. <verse eid="PHP 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18" />Nưq yôôych aleq? Long laa vii kach leq — long laa dơơp bô long laa hyioh dik — yôôych Lôôk Wơơt Dêh jah padoh taboon, ji gô hlah hlaak truh varơuq nưq. Panưh kadrơy, gô kung hnoq jah dơơp ka hlah hlaak, <verse eid="PHP 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19" />vii gô xet đaneq varơuq neq hnoq taway varơuq wơơt xok truh ka gô, gamưh varơuq apôôy ku oh ay ji varơuq waak xing Kơy Phool Hiel ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="PHP 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20" />tyauq đaji varơuq hlah hlaak takôô ji xuum takôô gamưh ku gô, nưq laa gô hnoq leh biq dơơp dong kamưưl đom dêq hloay varơuq kajoq, bơh kôk kalh đom tôôy varơuq, xôq tuôôy neq kung đaji pa kê tuôôy leq, Lôôk Wơơt Dêh hnoq jah vanê atok aduq xăk xamơk gô, ju laa riirh long kaxêêt. <verse eid="PHP 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21" />Vii đôôyq dii gô, riirh laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, ji kaxêêt laa varơuq ich lơơy. <verse eid="PHP 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22" />Bơh atoh măn riirh đom xăk xamơk, yôôych đôôyq dii gô nưq laa varơuq vlôh play ich lơơy ka varơuq dơơp, vii anưq gô leh xet gô hnoq rơơlh panưh leq. <verse eid="PHP 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23" />Gô biq ahnen katul vaarq panưh, tuôôy e xuum trôôch xôq vlôh hooy ji măn dii Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, vii nưq laa varơuq kaxay iaq thier 'ngưng, <verse eid="PHP 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24" />bơh kưq măn hlê đom xăk xamơk laa varơuq duh iaq ka oh ay. <verse eid="PHP 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25" />Tuôôy heq tuôq kajưk varơuq nưq, gô xet đaneq gô hnoq măn hlê ji măn hlê đnoyq dii dêq hloay oh ay, vii varơuq kôt tok ji varơuq hlah đom xuum tuôq ku oh ay, <verse eid="PHP 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26" />xôq varơuq pa ưưt ku oh ay đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu truh gô hnoq 'ngưng iaq gamưh varơuq gô truh tavơh oh ay yưk tra. <verse eid="PHP 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27" />Vơ e varơuq oh ay pheq riirh kach taxưngq dii Hêêl Kaxay ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, xôq long tuôôy gô truh ji 'yo oh ay long tuôôy wăngq mot, yôôych gô hnoq ik tameng truh oh ay đaneq oh ay dưk kajưk đom muuyq danưng kooy, dii muuyq xuum biit kung tahmơt vii xuum tuôq ku Hêêl Kaxay, <verse eid="PHP 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28" />ji leh biq khơl adro tachơơl hlê dơơp ka varaal yôq đom paq kê varơuq kajoq. Neq laa hlêêl dơuq truh varơuq hư hlơơp deng ka oot, bơh laa hlêêl dơuq truh varơuq wơơt xok ku oh ay — ji varơuq neq xing Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="PHP 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29" />Vii gamưh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, vanong heq jah kahniq ka oh ay leh vơ xôq tuôq aduq Kadraq, bơh kung xôq chiuq pơơl vii Kadraq, <verse eid="PHP 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30" />Tuôôy e kung varơuq tahmơt đơu oh ay heq hloq aduq gô, ji juneq đong tameng aduq gô.<verse eid="PHP 1:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1" />Vii anưq, atoh đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh e varơuq ahmưk nhăk leq, atoh e varơuq hlơq hlôôp leq xing xuum xung xiaq, atoh e varơuq ahlook aklah leq đom Kơy Phool Hiel, atoh e xuum xiaq trôôch ji varơuq angơuq leq, <verse eid="PHP 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2" />yôôych dayh dơơp xaleep varơuq hlah hlaak ku gô, nưq laa oh ay e kung xuum biit, tuôôy e kung xuum xung xiaq, kung muuyq xuum, biit truh kung muuyq trôôk. <verse eid="PHP 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3" />Leh dơơp varơuq kajoq jo xuum kamuk long vii hư hlơơp, wih hlê, dii xuum apôôt xăk, 'yo khơl kadrơy kul vado iaq xăk, <verse eid="PHP 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4" />tôôy adro leh vơ tabông truh qwuyen lơơy ku đêh ni, bơh măn qwuyen lơơy ku khơl kadrơy đnoyq. <verse eid="PHP 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5" />Dayh e xuum biit đanưq đom oh ay, kung laa xuum biit đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu,<verse eid="PHP 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6" />laa Kơy măn 'miêh đom long lơuq Kơy Plêêk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:6">heq leh 'yo varơuq duh pheq jư xok</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:6">laa varơuq xađong dii Kơy Plêêk.<verse eid="PHP 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7" />Tađôôy muut đnư, Kadraq heq dơơp kadih ka Kadraq vlôh hong heng</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">tuôôy hlưp xok xăk xamơk manih xapok,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">jah pa iir vlôh đom long lơuq dang đaji koot manih,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:7">ji jah 'yo hloq đom kaphook đaji muuyq koot manih,<verse eid="PHP 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8" />Kadraq heq kadih haaq xăk pôôt tuôôy chiuq tameng tyauq ka truh kaxêêt,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:8">pheq đnooy kaxêêt tol gay charăk.<verse eid="PHP 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9" />Vii nưq, Kơy Plêêk kung heq vanê Kadraq tok thier yơơt</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:9">ji heq kahniq ka Kadraq yal tol tôôy yal,<verse eid="PHP 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10" />xôq ka tameng truh yal Lôôk Jê-xu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:10">tôôy takuul tol plêêk, 'laarq vari, pi 'laarq vari, pheq kul pôôt,<verse eid="PHP 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11" />ji tôôy kapiet raay xưng nhonq đaneq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu laa Lôôk,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PHP 2:11">đơu tađnah tađnaak thuôk Kơy Plêêk, laa Vaq.<verse eid="PHP 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12" />Vii anưq, khơl adro xung xiaq ku gô lơơy, tyauq đaji kach oh ay heq hloay tameng apok, tuôôy leh vơ măn đom varơuq e mot ku gô, đơu juneq kang 'ngưng iaq đom varơuq wăngq mot ku gô, oh ay dayh kưq dơơp tyauq vanong wơơt xok ku oh ay dii varơuq kuh yôq ji padrau. <verse eid="PHP 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13" />Vii Kơy Plêêk laa Kơy đong dưk dơơp đom oh ay xôq vơơ trôôch vơơ dơơp tyauq iq kaxay ku Kadraq. <verse eid="PHP 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14" />Dayh dơơp tôôy varơuq đơu leh ramooy long takaay tayaat, <verse eid="PHP 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15" />xôq oh ay jah jêêk vlôh khơl adro koot leh e aduq đnooy trek ji paxa rêh ku Kơy Plêêk, be e hlêêl tachoot măn katul đom muuyq adrơơk xơk tauq ji xa agưt, đơu aduq nưq oh ay ahnhe tađnah đaji kaluh gooy đeen đom dêh araak, <verse eid="PHP 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16" />tuôôy jư kajưk apok varơuq riirh, vii varơuq pa ưưt ku gô đom hngơy ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh nưq laa gô heq leh charơơk đom hlo hloh, kung leh dơơp galeh galal kach hlo hloh. <verse eid="PHP 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17" />Bơh pheq đnooy long gô biq uk vahaap vlôh xôq para tol kuah lêh ji lêh vâk ku xuum tuôq oh ay, yôôch gô măn mưng me, ji hlah hlaak dii dêq hloay oh ay. <verse eid="PHP 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18" />Oh ay kung đanưq, dayh mưng me ji hlah hlaak dii gô.<verse eid="PHP 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19" />Đom Lôôk, laa Lôôk Jê-xu, gô takôô gamưh meel xôq atăq Ti-mô-thê truh hlơq oh ay, xôq gô kung biit hloq ahmưk nhăk tuôôy xet hêêl truh oh ay. <verse eid="PHP 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20" />Vii gô leh e kơyq dêq kung muuyq xuum dang đaji nhu nưq, laa adro dik xuum lo biit kaluh lơơy ich đôôyq dii oh ay, <verse eid="PHP 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21" />vii khơl kadrơy raay axek akhiim kaluh lơơy ich đêh, be aalq kaluh varơuq thuôk truh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="PHP 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22" />Bơh oh ay xet xuum klaak ku nhu nưq, vii dang đaji koot dii vaq, nhu nưq heq hơu varơuq ka Hêêl Kaxay kung dii gô. <verse eid="PHP 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23" />Vii anưq gô takôô gamưh patăk dăt nhu nưq hloay tuôôy gô xet jah varơuq ku gô hnoq đaleq. <verse eid="PHP 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24" />Bơh gô tuôq kajưk aduq Lôôk đaneq jơq gô kung hnoq meel truh hlơq oh ay. <verse eid="PHP 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25" />Panưh kadrơy, gô biit duh pheq atăq Ep-ba-phô-đich xuq hlê ka oh ay, nhu nưq laa dro oh ay ji 'wơyq kung dơơp varơuq kung laa 'wơyq kung hmơt jăk ku gô, laa adro jah patăk xing oh ay ji laa adro hơu varơuq ka varơuq duh ku gô, <verse eid="PHP 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26" />vii nhonq vlôh đaneq nhu dêq paraat takôô trôôch jah măn dii dêq hloay oh ay, ji biit hloq hlu rơu vii oh ay heq tameng đaneq nhu nưq biq jiq. <verse eid="PHP 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27" />Vii jơq laa nhu nưq heq biq jiq jeq kaxêêt, bơh Kơy Plêêk heq biit angơuq nhu nưq, đơu leh vơ nhu nưq heq 'leq, bơh măn gô đnoyq, xôq gô klơlh chiuq hlu rơu kang athêêp hlu rơu. <verse eid="PHP 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28" />Lunưq, gô pơl wol patăk nhu nưq hooy, xôq tuôôy tavơh hlê nhu nưq, oh ay hnoq ik hlah hlaak, ji gô kung jah đơ hlu rơu. <verse eid="PHP 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29" />Vii nưq, dayh tiip đoonq nhu nưq đom Lôôk bơơn dêq hloay varơuq hlah hlaak, ji kung dayh e xuum vado khơl adro đanưq, <verse eid="PHP 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30" />bơyh vii dơơp varơuq ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh đơu nhu nưq pheq đnooy jeq kaxêêt, tuôôy hôôk ka'lăk xăk riirh nhu xôq hnoq ik dơơp xaleep phon măn thiuq đom varơuq dơơp ku oh ay deng ka gô.<verse eid="PHP 2:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1" />Atêq lôôch, wơơy oh ay ku gô, dayh hlah hlaak đom Lôôk. Đôôyq dii gô, be tawaq kajoq tuôôy valơk hlê kung kaluh varơuq neq ka oh ay, vii laa varơuq hrok hrol deng ka oh ay. <verse eid="PHP 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2" />Dayh rơơt rol kaluh xo, dayh rơơt rol khơl adro dơơp kông xơk tauq, dayh rơơt rol pheep goch kađuh pa ôôh. <verse eid="PHP 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3" />Vii haay chiuq pheep goch kađuh dik — nưq laa khơl dro ayuôôt laat bơơn Kơy Phool Hiel ku Kơy Plêêk, pa ưưt đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, ji leh takôô gamưh aduq xăk xamơk, <verse eid="PHP 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4" />long gô pheq đnooy e kơq takôô gamưh aduq xăk xamơk. Atoh kơyq nưq biit e kơq xôq gamưh aduq xăk xamơk, yôôych gô măn e 'ngưng iaq: <verse eid="PHP 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5" />gô chiuq pheep goch kađuh muut hngơy thưq thơơm, thuôk tamooy I-sơ-ra-ên, bing ja Bên-ja-min, manih Hê-bơ-rơ, koot ku manih Hê-bơ-rơ; tyauq ganuun, laa manih Pha-ri-si; <verse eid="PHP 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6" />truh xuum talăng jăk yôôych rôp toop tayuup vah; truh varơuq hyioh jăk tyauq ganuun yôôych jah ăm laa leh e aduq đnooy trek. <verse eid="PHP 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7" />Lunư, paq kê varơuq kajoq 'miêh laa lơơy đôôyq dii gô, yôôych vii kơq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, gô heq 'yo kaluh nưq laa lôôh. <verse eid="PHP 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8" />Bơh măn iaq đanưq đnoyq, gô pheq đnooy 'yo dêq hloay raay laa lôôh vii kơq jaq triq galơh iaq dêq ku varơuq nhonq xet truh Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, Lôôk ku gô, vii Kadraq đơu gô heq chiuq hlơơp dêq hloay — dik, gô 'yo kaluh nưq đaji ka'nhah ka'nhau — xôq ka gô jah Lôôk Wơơt Dêh <verse eid="PHP 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9" />ji jah axek hloq đom Kadraq, leh aalq vii e varơuq hyioh jăk aduq xăk xamơk gô xing ganuun bơh laa varơuq hyioh jăk gamưh xuum tuôq aduq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh — nưq laa varơuq hyioh jăk truh xing Kơy Plêêk tol kahnier xuum tuôq — <verse eid="PHP 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10" />xôq nhonq xet Kadraq ji taay yaak varơuq riirh hlê ku Kadraq kung dii varơuq ahlook đom kaluh pơơl dal ku Kadraq, tuôôy jah taway truh aduq dang dii varơuq kaxêêt ku Kadraq, <verse eid="PHP 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11" />long bơơn kach leq, yôôych gô hnoq ik jah truh varơuq riirh hlê xing varơuq kaxêêt. <verse eid="PHP 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12" />Nưq leh aalq laa gô heq jah kadrool yôôch, long heq jah xaleep yôôch, bơh gô đong charơơk tyauq xôq aleq ka gô hnoq ik tagoa xok kadrool đơu vii kơq nưq, gô kung heq jah Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu tagoa xok. <verse eid="PHP 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13" />Wơơy oh ay, gô leh ăm laa kadih xăk gô heq tagoa jah. Bơh gô kưq dơơp muuyq varơuq: tuôôy tawol dêq kaluh kajoq pi katoor đơu kathôp truh kaluh varơuq pi ngưưr, <verse eid="PHP 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14" />wih truh muuyq varơuq, gô đong chawiq tyauq xôq dong jah kadrool truh varơuq tawooyh taayh măn tol plêêk ku Kơy Plêêk đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="PHP 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15" />Vii anưq, dêq hloay khơl leq kôt tok raay duh 'yo biit đanưq, măn atoh e aduq leq oh ay biit kach đêh raa, Kơy Plêêk kung hnoq kahnoq vlôh varơuq nưq ka oh ay. <verse eid="PHP 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16" />Lunư, haay heq jah truh mưk leq yôôych dayh tawaak hooy tyauq mưk nưq.<verse eid="PHP 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17" />Wơơy oh ay, dayh jêêk vlôh khơl adro atôôlh tyauq gô, ji dayh 'yo muut khơl dro đong riirh đom kach nưq, tyauq đaji ramil oh ay hloq aduq 'wot. <verse eid="PHP 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18" />Vii e 'ngưng manih — laa khơl dro đơu gô heq ragơy đnooy dii oh ay, bơh juneq gô pheq đnooy pheq nhim đơu đnooy — oot đong riirh đaji khơl dro tachơơl hlê gay charăk ku Lôôk Wơơt Dêh, <verse eid="PHP 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19" />lôôch dik ku khơl adro nưq laa hư hlơơp, lôôk ku oot laa vaduk klaak, ji tađnah tađnaak ku oot măn đom varơuq dơơp thier kamưưl ku oot, nưq laa khơl adro vơ biit truh kaluh varơuq dêh araak. <verse eid="PHP 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20" />Bơh vii qwuyen adro koot ku haay e 'miêh tol plêêk, đơu xing aduq nưq haay hlah hlaak takôô Kơy Wơơt Xok, laa Lôôk, nưq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, <verse eid="PHP 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21" />laa Kơy hnoq tađôôy đơơu xăk xamơk adrah ku haay jêêk vlôh dang dii xăk xamơk tađnah tađnaak ku Kadraq, dang tyauq varơuq dưk dơơp ku taay yaak Kadraq xôq rôp băt kaluh paroh ka Kadraq.<verse eid="PHP 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1" />Nưq yôôych, wơơy oh ay xung xiaq ji văch takôô ku gô, xuum hlah hlaak ji đoat ku gô, oh ay xung xiaq lơơy, dayh kưq dưk kajưk đanưq đom Lôôk.<verse eid="PHP 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2" />Gô ahmưk nhăk Ê-vô-đi ji ahmưk nhăk Sin-ti-kơ e kung muuyq xuum biit đom Lôôk. <verse eid="PHP 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3" />Kajưk dik đaneq, gô kung xiin ay, adro kung dơơp varơuq dong dik lơơy, ay dayh waak khơl mư nưq, oot heq kung gô tahmơt ka Hêêl Kaxay, kung dii Kơ-lê-măn ji khơl 'wơyq kung dơơp varơuq kadrơy ku gô, đơu anơng ku oot măn đom Rahlăp Varơuq Riirh.<verse eid="PHP 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4" />Dayh kưq hloay hlah hlaak đom Lôôk. Gô hnoq đnooy đnoyq, dayh hlah hlaak yơu! <verse eid="PHP 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5" />Dayh xôq tôôy dro xet xuum klaak hien tagu ku oh ay. Lôôk heq jeq yôôch. <verse eid="PHP 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6" />Te biit lo kajoq dêq, tađôôy muut đnư, đom tôôy varơuq, bơơn varơuq apôôy ji apôôy vôôch kung dii varơuq kuh kway, dayh xôq kaluh apok apôôy vôôch ku oh ay jah đnooy vlôh ka Kơy Plêêk, <verse eid="PHP 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7" />yôôch varơuq hrok hrol ku Kơy Plêêk, laa varơuq galơh iaq tôôy hlolh xet, hnoq jư 'yo xuum oh ay ji xuum biit ku oh ay đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu.<verse eid="PHP 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8" />Atêq lôôch, wơơy oh ay, atoh varơuq kajoq laa dong dik, atoh varơuq kajoq đangq vado, atoh varơuq kajoq hyioh jăk, atoh varơuq kajoq paxa rêh, atoh varơuq kajoq đangq xiaq, atoh varơuq kajoq e xarooy kaxay, atoh varơuq leq e katik tolh ji atoh varơuq leq đangq vado, yôôych oh ay pheq biit truh kaluh nưq. <verse eid="PHP 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9" />Kaluh varơuq oh ay heq hok xet, heq nhonq xok, heq tameng ji heq hloq aduq gô, yôôych dayh dơơp tyauq kaluh varơuq nưq, yôôch Kơy Plêêk hrok hrol hnoq măn kung oh ay.<verse eid="PHP 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10" />Gô thier jah hlah hlaak đom Lôôk vii juneq lôôch dik oh ay laay tabông truh gô, dong dik, đom varơuq neq, oh ay 'miêh heq tabông truh gô, bơh leh e kawah xôq kahnoq vlôh. <verse eid="PHP 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11" />Nưq be aalq laa gô đnooy truh varơuq duh gô, vii gô heq hok pheq hlah xuum long gô măn đom varơuq xalih truh leq. <verse eid="PHP 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12" />Gô vơơ xet biq adrah, vơơ xet e raah jôh. Đom tưng tôôy varơuq ji đom tôôy aduq, gô heq hok kaah tuôôy jah phiq ji tuôôy chiuq pangoot, kaah tuôôy e raah jôh ji tuôôy biq thiuq. <verse eid="PHP 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13" />Gô e đu paraat xôq dơơp dêq hloay gamưh Kơy dơơp ka gô kalh paraat. <verse eid="PHP 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14" />Lunư, oh ay heq dơơp tolh tuôôy kung ahlook aklah varơuq pơơl hwơơl ku gô. <verse eid="PHP 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15" />Wơơy oh ay theng Phi-lip, oh ay kung xet đaneq đom hngơy patep ku Hêêl Kaxay, tuôôy gô vlôh klơlh Ma-xê-đoan, leh e tayuup vah leq ahlook dii gô đom varơuq baak jêêt, đêh vlôh muuyq adro oh ay, <verse eid="PHP 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16" />vii hloay aduq Tê-sa-lô-ni-ka, oh ay heq muuyq vaarq yưk atăq tuôông duh xung ka gô. <verse eid="PHP 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17" />Nưq leh aalq laa gô trôôch axek kadrool, đơu gô trôôch axek raak play athêêp tok raah jôh muut phon e ich lơơy ku oh ay. <verse eid="PHP 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18" />Gô đong e đu tôôy thưq ji raah jôh đnoyq. Gô heq jah đu, tuôôy nhonq aduq Ep-ba-phô-đich atăq kadrool truh xing oh ay, laa muuy thơơm, laa kuah lêh jah nhonq xok, laa varơuq kaxay xuum Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="PHP 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19" />Kơy Plêêk ku gô hnoq kahniq ăm đu tôôy varơuq duh ku oh ay tyauq varơuq karoh e ku Kadraq đom varơuq tađnah tađnaak aduq Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. <verse eid="PHP 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20" />Apôôy tađnah tađnaak thuôk xuq Kơy Plêêk, Vaq haay, dong truh đơơy đơơy miet miet. Amen.<verse eid="PHP 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21" />Xiin vôôch hlơq tôôy khơl vah đom Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu. Khơl oh ay măn kung gô vôôch hlơq oh ay. <verse eid="PHP 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22" />Dêq hloay khơl vah vôôch hlơq oh ay, đơu yưk laa khơl adro thuôk hnhư Sê-sa.<verse eid="PHP 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23" />Apôôy vanong plêêk ku Lôôk, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu măn kung danưng kooy oh ay. Amen.<verse eid="PHP 4:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4" />
</usx>